    <briefdescription>
<para>Implementation of the shared API transport policy enforcement middleware. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements <computeroutput>TransportPolicyMiddleware</computeroutput> which wraps any <computeroutput>IHttpHandler</computeroutput> and enforces the canonical transport-level policy rules (Phase 2 + Phase 3, Q4 2026) before delegating to the application handler.</para>
<para>All policy violations are fail-closed: the request is rejected immediately with a structured error produced by <computeroutput>ApiErrorTaxonomy</computeroutput>. The wrapped handler is not called on a violation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
